menu "WiEvac transmitter"

config WIEVAC_RX1_MAC
    string "Expected RX-1 Wi-Fi MAC (optional closed-lab fallback)"
    default ""
    help
        When set, only pair replies from this MAC are accepted for RX-1.
        Leave empty only for trusted closed-lab pairing.

config WIEVAC_RX2_MAC
    string "Expected RX-2 Wi-Fi MAC (optional closed-lab fallback)"
    default ""
    help
        When set, only pair replies from this MAC are accepted for RX-2.
        Leave empty only for trusted closed-lab pairing.

endmenu
